    {
      "number": 57,
      "category": "",
      "title": "卷末評",
      "paragraph_id": "c-sanguozhi-057-appraisal:line099",
      "count": 1,
      "raw_count": 1,
      "duplicate_count": 0,
      "counting_policy": "independent_fixed_witness_occurrences",
      "quote": "才藻俊茂，而智防未備，用致艱患。駱統抗明大義，辭切理至，值權方閉不開。陸瑁篤義規諫，君子有稱焉。吾粲、朱據遭罹屯蹇，以正喪身，悲夫！",
      "paragraph_ids": [
        "c-sanguozhi-057-appraisal:line099"
      ],
